                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "17097972-7d2f-3ac9-b935-5b270c8c847b",
                        "entry_id": "4fa88199-48c2-3c81-8123-b5c52d06a5aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "камень или раковина с художественной резьбой; украшение в виде броши из такого камня или раковины"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "954604c0-1e60-48c9-8d8f-40afcc3584ff",
                                "sense_id": "17097972-7d2f-3ac9-b935-5b270c8c847b",
                                "text": "«Да, Леонтий прав: это — камея; какой профиль, какая строгая, чистая линия затылка, шеи!…»"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb8e28c8-dc86-4b07-a32e-f95ba29ce0ee",
                                "sense_id": "17097972-7d2f-3ac9-b935-5b270c8c847b",
                                "text": "В самом деле, не говоря уже о важнейших произведениях древнего резца, — камея, барельеф, медаль, посуда в форме человеческой или львиной головы, каждая безделка в этом роде есть художественное произведение и в тысячу раз выше лучшей статуи даже Кановы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01fff3ab-b205-42f0-977c-567f51dc1c99",
                                "sense_id": "17097972-7d2f-3ac9-b935-5b270c8c847b",
                                "text": "Дочь его пожалована была во фрейлины в 1826 году, и когда явилась, во время коронации Николая Павловича в Москве, на бал, обратила на себя общее внимание медалионом, в котором вделана была редкая и известная по истории искусства камея, исчезнувшая из придворной коллекции в сороковых годах XVIII века: она досталась ей от покойного дяди."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e2a4b007-3106-3165-9112-43f43e22c14a",
                        "entry_id": "4fa88199-48c2-3c81-8123-b5c52d06a5aa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техника резьбы по камню с выпуклым (позитивным) рельефом"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "423400aa-a581-4a52-8ce3-62d7579e481c",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fa88199-48c2-3c81-8123-b5c52d06a5aa",
                        "target_lang_word": "cameo",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cameo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f2edb0b-9849-33ac-931b-8063f8f2d7c5",
                                        "entry_id": "77eb37bc-d417-3598-8379-c5d32d129bca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A piece of jewelry, etc., carved in relief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b6e49c7-d906-4c6e-9927-52c2ba6ee198",
                                                "sense_id": "6f2edb0b-9849-33ac-931b-8063f8f2d7c5",
                                                "text": "Aarfy's buxom trollop had vanished with her smutty cameo ring, and Nurse Duckett was ashamed of him because he had refused to fly more combat missions and would cause a scandal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a1c0372-3b0c-3423-9663-bee99b185031",
                                        "entry_id": "77eb37bc-d417-3598-8379-c5d32d129bca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A single very brief appearance, especially by a prominent celebrity in a movie or song."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84a098a9-4c8e-4dea-9876-ae972344270f",
                                                "sense_id": "3a1c0372-3b0c-3423-9663-bee99b185031",
                                                "text": "Famous comic book writer Stan Lee had a cameo in the Spider-Man movie. He was on screen for perhaps ten seconds, but aficionados distinctly remember him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "282932c4-2f62-4162-b726-1f477970bd4d",
                                                "sense_id": "3a1c0372-3b0c-3423-9663-bee99b185031",
                                                "text": "As they turned into Hertford Street they startled a robin from the poet's head on a barren fountain, and he fled away with a cameo note."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cadf6d1e-a856-4a8e-ba2f-671364cf268f",
                                                "sense_id": "3a1c0372-3b0c-3423-9663-bee99b185031",
                                                "text": "Southgate will have been delighted to give Foden the first of many England caps while Greenwood will also have enjoyed his taste of international action during his cameo after coming on as a substitute for Kane."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23dec76e-3995-4c1b-b429-d3395db802a5",
                                                "sense_id": "3a1c0372-3b0c-3423-9663-bee99b185031",
                                                "text": "Dr. Helen O’Connell, Australia’s first female urologist, recalled that in her own medical training, the clitoris barely made a cameo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cameo",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ccb8a6c-3665-3eb2-99d5-5c7f85d2e550",
                                        "entry_id": "0a52228f-e398-3831-abf1-2b8d608388bf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To appear in a cameo role."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "87c6fe23-cec9-4cce-b9a7-14233612b03e",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fa88199-48c2-3c81-8123-b5c52d06a5aa",
                        "target_lang_word": "camafeo",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "camafeo",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "990a19d3-e45a-386c-8404-8aab71898e8c",
                                        "entry_id": "1604dc17-1a23-3d41-a7b1-dc3df8a93119",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ónice u otra piedra preciosa, con una figura tallada en relieve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6c35493-feac-4326-b961-d35b970762f1",
                                                "sense_id": "990a19d3-e45a-386c-8404-8aab71898e8c",
                                                "text": "¡Oh, célebre museo y plausible teatro de toda esta antigua griega y romana cultura, así en estatuas como en piedras, ya en sellos anulares, ya en monedas, vasos, urnas, láminas y camafeos, el de nuestro mayor amigo, el culto y erudito don Vincencio Juan de Lastanosa, honor de los romanos por su memoria, gloria de los aragoneses por su ingenio!"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f41db2b5-2982-4258-b91b-a668bf8b5d2a",
                        "source_entry_id": "4fa88199-48c2-3c81-8123-b5c52d06a5aa",
